# Future and imperative verb forms that place कल on TOMORROW: "कल की दावत में
# आना ज़रूर" (be sure to come to tomorrow's feast).  Source: native answer,
# chronologia#1484 (comment 7209012484).  The forms are the imperative and
# future of आना "to come" and the future of होना "to be" (en.wiktionary.org,
# entries "आना" and "होना", conjugation tables).
आना
आइए
आइये
आएगा
आएगी
आएँगे
आएंगे
होगा
होगी
होंगे
